{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14147","headline":"上桂州李大夫 · 戎昱","name":"上桂州李大夫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今日辞门馆，情将衆别殊。\n感深翻有泪，仁过曲怜愚。\n晚镜伤秋鬓，晴寒切病驱。\n烟霞万里阔，宇宙一身孤。\n倚马才宁有，登龙意岂无。\n唯於方寸内，暗贮报恩珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}